From 7514b68a6de7ee9ef1f3241cd8ad8fa69c18950e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sam (local build)" <sam@local>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 11:28:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/27] dde-emu v1h: PICO_FR_USB_FAST on for the emulator build
 (1 KB transfers; USB model + logger chunk/speed tests); start profiles short
 (default, 82 ~D+170 ms)/realistic (~D+840)/run8 via logger --start-profile
 (0xa7 wIndex), Fred's E6 b4 26, E8 crank rate, 0x3FB f0, 0x92 +20 ms; CAS
 refusal flags + loud logger/console lines; echo-miss diagnostics (0xaa, 64 B)
 + optional resched guard (off); engine status v2 (56 B); checker: 0x397
 running 60 ms, crank/rpm latency, 0x1B3 KL50, 0x92, refusal; README-v1h; immo
 IDs unchanged

